    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632523952941433429&sectionId=632523952991830613)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOk0wzDQdA_text","label":"ggOk0wzDQdA_text","default":"Turn Your Favorite Family Stories Into Something You Can See"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6T6dKlnFx_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg6T6dKlnFx_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/a980a7ec-30e1-4a66-98c0-d1ff00451a7f.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCx2cT5hFF_text","label":"ggCx2cT5hFF_text","default":"<p>Family stories are often passed down through conversations, old photographs, and memories shared around the dinner table. They tell us where we came from, remind us of the people we love, and help connect different generations. But some of those stories deserve more than words. They deserve something you can see every day.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDIizuM6Ew_text","label":"ggDIizuM6Ew_text","default":"Every Family Has a Story Worth Remembering"},{"type":"html","id":"ggczZzwDaD6_text","label":"ggczZzwDaD6_text","default":"<p>An imbalanced diet for your cat occurs when they do not receive the proper nutrients &amp; nourishment they require on a regular basis. This can happen if your cat is not fed a high-quality, complete &amp; balanced cat food like our premium pâté. An imbalanced diet may lead to various health issues for your feline companion.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWmUEQj1Us_text","label":"ggWmUEQj1Us_text","default":"Every Family Has a Story Worth Remembering"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiEngawj_e_text","label":"ggiEngawj_e_text","default":"<p>Every family has moments that become part of its story. It could be a childhood adventure, a memorable vacation, a wedding day, a funny family gathering, or a simple afternoon that everyone still talks about years later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These moments may seem ordinary when they happen, but over time, they can become some of the memories we treasure most. A photograph can capture one of those moments and give everyone a way to revisit the story whenever they see it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFJpb5sfUt_text","label":"ggFJpb5sfUt_text","default":"<p>A photograph does more than show what someone looked like. It can bring back the emotions, people, and experiences surrounding that moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One family photo might remind you of the trip where everyone got lost but eventually found their way. Another might bring back memories of a grandparent's birthday or a child's first big milestone.</p><p>When you see the photograph again, the story comes back with it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPHw7OOI85_text","label":"ggPHw7OOI85_text","default":"Turn a Family Story Into Something You Can Build"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-sa-tVxgj_text","label":"gg-sa-tVxgj_text","default":"<p>Memobrick gives families a creative way to transform meaningful photographs into personalized brick mosaics.</p><p>Instead of leaving a favorite family photo hidden in a phone or computer, you can turn it into something you can physically build and display. Each brick becomes part of the image, while the finished mosaic becomes a visual reminder of the story behind it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The building process can also become part of the story. Families can work together, talk about the photograph, share memories, and enjoy the experience of watching the image slowly come together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_label","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_unavailableLabel","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_successMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_errorMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"}],
